## Acceptance boundary

This closes the default internal-producer sync retry behavior for retry-topic
fallback. The optional `sendLatencyEnable=true` fault-selector behavior and
broader P18-V01 source/API/settings/input/error/control-flow and reverse-export
reconciliation remain open. Native Windows runtime and current-revision remote
CI are separate gates. Phase 19 Broker/Docker work remains outside scope. The
four user-owned Phase 19 workspace paths and the reference checkout's existing
untracked `broker/src/test/java/org/apache/rocketmq/broker/aaaa.java` were left
untouched. No push or remote CI was run.
